{"resourceIdentifier":"3908","resourceName":"INEGOL INTEGRATED SOLID WASTE STORAGE AND DISPOSAL FACILITY","description":"The project is located in Bursa Province, İnegöl District, Yeniyörük Mahallesi, Körkuyu. The project İnegöl Integrated Solid Waste Landfill and Disposal Facility (Mechanical Separation Facility, Waste Derived Fuel Preparation Facility and Biomethanization Facility) is operated by Doğu Star Elektrik Üretim A.Ş. The Project Activity includes the Mechanical Separation Facility, the Refused Drive Fuel (RDF) preparation facility, and the Biomethanization Facility, which operates in integration with the existing solid waste landfill facility (SWDS). Within the scope of the project, it is planned to manage the municipal wastes, produce electricity with biogas and produce RDF fuel. The start date of the project activity is considered as 31-December-2020, which is the provisional acceptance date of the first gas engine. Project is estimated to produce 730,000 tCO2e net emission reduction over the 7 year crediting period. This project has contributed to the following goals: • Reduction in fossil fuel use (imported or local) by using renewable energy resources. • Displacement of ecologically unsound and climate unfriendly power generation • Extension of nationally sourced power generation. • Improvement of environmental conditions (GHG and odour) and safety in the landfill area • Increase the lifespan of İnegöl SWDS by utilizing biodegradable fraction of MSW more efficiently.","location":{"latitude":40.149582,"longitude":29.582027},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-23","endExclusive":"2023-04-23","endInclusive":"2023-04-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3908"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"İnegöl"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"104285"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"03/09/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/12/2020 - 30/12/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86999&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk119971621","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_3908_20MAR2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-23T13:47:21.527Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=77617&IDKEY=9lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098l107033843","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Deed_Inegol.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-01T15:16:44.757Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=137449&IDKEY=k98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8dl189542171","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"INEGOL_PDD_PRR_R3_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-09-03T06:15:01.097Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=105241&IDKEY=3q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk145127339","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"BIOTREND vs MVC vs GAIA - VCS Registration Deed of Representation - INEGOL .pdf","uploadDate":"2023-12-31T10: